{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04124","headline":"题巴州光福寺楠木 · 史俊","name":"题巴州光福寺楠木","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"近郭城南山寺深，亭亭奇树出禅林。\n结根幽壑不知岁，耸干摩天凡几寻。\n翠色晚将岚气合，月光时有夜猨吟。\n经行绿叶望成盖，宴坐黄花长满襟。\n此木尝闻生豫章，今朝独秀在巴乡。\n凌霜不肯让松柏，作宇由来称栋梁。\n会待良工时一眄，应归法水作慈航。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"史俊","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_04124.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04124","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}